\newlabel{tab:spatial-bowl}{{4}{5}{Per-task breakdown on \texttt {spatial\_bowl} (SDF $\lambda {=}0.005$, seed0, 200 episodes). CAR is lower than \texttt {object\_pudding} due to denser obstacle configurations. No LoRA-only control was available for this scene, precluding SDF attribution}{table.caption.12}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces 3v3 seed-level comparison: LoRA-only vs.\ SDF. The mean CAR difference is not statistically significant at either $\lambda $ value. SDF $\lambda {=}0.01$ shows notably lower cross-seed variance (SD = 0.3\,pp), suggesting a possible regularization effect, but this does not translate to performance gains.}}{5}{table.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:3v3}{{5}{5}{3v3 seed-level comparison: LoRA-only vs.\ SDF. The mean CAR difference is not statistically significant at either $\lambda $ value. SDF $\lambda {=}0.01$ shows notably lower cross-seed variance (SD = 0.3\,pp), suggesting a possible regularization effect, but this does not translate to performance gains}{table.caption.13}{}}
